{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And Moses saw the people, that it was exposed.</b> Like באין חזון יפרע עם (Proverbs 29:18) and ותפרעו כל עצתי (ibid. 1:25)." "<b>And the word לשמצה.</b> A noun of attribution in place of a verbal noun, because they were a שמץ and disgrace and calumny:" "<b>בקמיהם.</b> Like רבים קמו עלי (Psalms 3:2), also מן קמי (ibid. 18:49), by way of ellipsis. And the Aramaic targum [renders] according to the regular usage, והנה קמתם תחת אבותיכם (Numbers 32:14):"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:53.711162308Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}